        "archetype": "effect-before-cause",
        "maker": "the-oncewill",
        "tier": "relic",
        "note": "A reply with no message. The Oncewill answered a question the colony has not asked yet."
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "artifacts/the-undated-anachronism-24",
      "type": "artifact",
