        "title": "Imrie re-sorts the finds and the meaning of every earlier relic flips"
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "events/present-1-vash-races-the-edit",
      "type": "event",
      "tension": 0.8,
      "day": 1110,
      "facts": {
        "kind": "race",
        "title": "Vash drives the team toward the last anachronism before the Undated can un-find it"
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "arcs/the-last-relic",
      "type": "arc",
      "tension": 0.9,
      "facts": {
        "phase": "rising",
        "next_beat_kind": "discovery",
        "next_beat_faction": "civs/the-undated",
        "status": "open",
        "note": "OPEN. The colony is one relic from reconstructing the war's true sequence — but placing the last find is itself a move, and the Undated are reaching back to edit whichever ending the colonists choose. Whoever sequences last decides whether the Erevan ever existed."
      }
    }
